ce_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=(V_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(V=(V_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrefixFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrefixFree}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7071caa967351d5\" href=\"?note=e7071caa967351d5\" title=\"43-df-prefixfree\">43-df-prefixfree</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OpenHull}\">\\(\\operatorname{OpenHull}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongSTest}_s(V)\\iff\\mathrm{CE}(\\{(k,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbb N\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\sigma\\in V_k\\})\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall P\\subseteq V_k\\,[\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(P)\\Rightarrow\\sum_{\\sigma\\in P}2^{-s|\\sigma|}\\le2^{-k}].\n\\qquad\\mathrm{StrongSRandom}_s(X)\\iff\\forall V\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\\,[\\mathrm{StrongSTest}_s(V)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{OpenHull}(V_k)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{StrongSTest}_s(V)\\iff\\mathrm{CE}(\\{(k,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbb N\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\sigma\\in V_k\\})\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall P\\subseteq V_k\\,[\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(P)\\Rightarrow\\sum_{\\sigma\\in P}2^{-s|\\sigma|}\\le2^{-k}].\n\\qquad\\mathrm{StrongSRandom}_s(X)\\iff\\forall V\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\\,[\\mathrm{StrongSTest}_s(V)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{OpenHull}(V_k)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>强测试允许嵌套串，但对任意前缀自由子集控制权重；不是只要求原串集前缀自由。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixfree","status":"resolved","id":"e7071caa967351d5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixfree]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixfree","status":"resolved","id":"e7071caa967351d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$V=(V_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{<\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}$；$\\mathrm{PrefixFree}$ 见 [[43-df-prefixfree]]，$\\operatorname{OpenHull}$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$V=(V_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{<\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}$；$\\mathrm{PrefixFree}$ 见 [[43-df-prefixfree]]，$\\operatorname{OpenHull}$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"V=(V_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{<\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{P